{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132010/extras/53456f076e033128ca508b029579a3b2.avif?t=1762986656\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132010/extras_big/53456f076e033128ca508b029579a3b2.webp?t=1762986656 width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There are no losers, only dead bodies\u2026</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're completely broke. Your journey towards financial betterment, left you resultless. While searching for some sort of a miracle that will put you out of poverty, you stumble upon a sketchy underground Pub. Turns out that people there organize beer pong tournaments with big cash prizes , but there is one, dark twist... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You sign up with what's left of your cash, the bouncer suddenly puts a hot collar around your neck and announces the beginning of the next round. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't turn back. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to earn money, You will have to win against a number of contestants presented to you, and if you dare, challenge the final enemy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 chances to win... unless....</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match is divided into 3 rounds, the loser of the round is struck with an electric shock. Whilst preparing the next one, barman Gustav offers you both a variety of free, special shots. You can pay him for some of the newest ones on the menu. Thanks to them, uou can sabotage the enemy, play it safe, or focus on boosting your skill- it's your call! But beware, you will get consequently drunker. You can also chat with Gustav, who may give you tips, bonus challenges, and a chance to befriend him. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leave or dig deeper.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eventually, you will be satisfied with your money but there are still mysteries left here... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game modes.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 2 game modes avaible right now!\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic</strong>-\u00a0where you practise your throws and earn small amounts of money. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat</strong>- where the game of life and death begins.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music created by Dabi Sarapuk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132010/extras/353a4bc1f896fb1dab239e8685f70c0d.avif?t=1762986656\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132010/extras_big/353a4bc1f896fb1dab239e8685f70c0d.webp?t=1762986656 width=1560 height=390 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4132010?t=1762986656","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132010/c8fe25c9306b774376a7f336b0a7ca081e547bba/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762986656","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132010/82c3be2d8db4752739e67343ddc36e5942fc536d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762986656","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132010/82c3be2d8db4752739e67343ddc36e5942fc536d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762986656","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","